@startuml component_ui
title Компоненты UI (PySide6) и их взаимодействие с сервисами — ТЗ п. 10.1

package "rcad.ui" {
  [MainWindow] as MW
  [LibraryPanel] as LIB
  [SchematicScene] as SCENE
  [PropertyPanel] as PROPS
  [HierarchyNavigator] as HIER
  [NetlistView] as NLV
  [AnalysisDialog] as ADLG
  [PlotWindow\n(pyqtgraph)] as PLOT
  [MessageLog] as LOG
  [ImportVaWizard] as VAWIZ
  [ShortcutMap] as KEYS
  [CommandPalette] as CMD
  [CanvasApi\n(Qt-free facade)] as API

  MW --> LIB
  MW --> SCENE
  MW --> PROPS
  MW --> LOG
  MW --> HIER
  MW --> NLV
  MW --> ADLG
  ADLG --> PLOT
  KEYS --> SCENE
  KEYS --> ADLG
  CMD --> SCENE
  VAWIZ --> LIB
  API --> SCENE : схема-API без Qt
}

package "rcad.services" {
  [ProjectService] as PS
  [Netlister] as NL
  [ModelManager] as MM
  [SimulatorService] as SIM
  [VaImportService] as VAI
  [ResultStore] as RS
}

SCENE --> API : изменения документа\n(QUndoCommand → pydantic)
PROPS --> API : set_params / instance_params
HIER --> PS : cells/
NLV --> NL : export/import\n(module-функции)
ADLG --> SIM : run(AnalysisSpec)
SIM --> PLOT : Result по сигналу finished
PLOT --> RS : экспорт CSV/PNG
VAWIZ --> VAI : import_file(.va)
LOG <-- PS : diagnostics
LOG <-- SIM : diagnostics

note bottom of SCENE
  Модель документа — pydantic-объекты, сцена — её
  представление; любое действие идёт через
  QUndoCommand (≥ 50 шагов, FR-SEL-005).
  При ≥ 500 инстансах антиалиасинг отключается,
  перерисовка ≤ 30 fps (NFR-PERF-UI).
end note

note bottom of API
  Qt-free: services и ui/api не импортируют PySide6
  (проверяет tests/unit/test_layering.py).
end note

note bottom of SIM
  Расчёт в QThread; обмен только сигналами
  progress/finished/failed; отмена — discard результата
  воркера (core-level cancel-флаг отложен).
end note

@enduml
